(*"product_property_representation_schema.chained_representation_link"
The *chained_representation_link* type allows for the designation of a <<express:representation_schema.mapped_item,mapped_item>>, a <<express:representation_schema.representation_context,representation_context>>, or a <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.represented_definition"
The *represented_definition* type allows for the designation of a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.general_property,general_property>>, a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.property_definition,property_definition>>, a <<express:material_property_definition_schema.property_definition_relationship,property_definition_relationship>>, a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect,shape_aspect>>, or a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect_relationship,shape_aspect_relationship>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage"
A *chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage* is a type of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage,item_identified_representation_usage>> that represents a chain of representations in a graph of representations, where the undirected links in the graph can be instances of entity data types <<express:representation_schema.representation_context,representation_context>>, <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>>, or <<express:representation_schema.mapped_item,mapped_item>>. The directed links are derived from the nodes and undirected links and consist solely of instances of the entity data type <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>>. The attribute <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship.rep_2,rep_2>> of the derived instances is directed towards the root, while the attribute <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship.rep_1,rep_1>> is directed towards the leaf.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.nodes"
the list of <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> in the chain.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.undirected_link"
the list of items that relate nodes in the chain.

[NOTE]
--
The items in the *undirected_link* are placed correctly relative to the nodes in the chain but are not guaranteed to have a consistent direction along the chain.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.root"
the node that is the initial terminus of the chain.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.leaf"
the node that is the final terminus of the chain.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.directed_link"
the list of <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>> that are derived from the *undirected_link* and that are consistently directed from the root to the leaf.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.wr:WR1"
The <<express:product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.directed_link,directed_link>> attribute shall be valid for the given set of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.nodes,nodes>> and <<express:product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.undirected_link,undirected_link>>s.

[NOTE]
--
the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.get_directed_link,get_directed_link>> function returns indeterminate if it cannot construct a valid list. The EXPRESS EXISTS function returns FALSE with an indeterminate input.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.wr:WR2"
The *root* shall be referenced by the attribute <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship.rep_1,rep_1>> of the initial member of the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.directed_link,directed_link>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.wr:WR3"
The *leaf* shall be referenced by the attribute <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship.rep_2,rep_2>> of the final member of the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.directed_link,directed_link>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.wr:WR4"
If the first element in <<express:product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.undirected_link,undirected_link>> is a <<express:representation_schema.mapped_item,mapped_item>>, then it shall be used in the root representation.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation"
A *characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation* is a type of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.characterized_item_within_representation,characterized_item_within_representation>> that represents a chain of representations in a graph of representations, where the undirected links in the graph can be instances of entity data types <<express:representation_schema.representation_context,representation_context>>, <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>>, or <<express:representation_schema.mapped_item,mapped_item>>. The directed links are derived from the nodes and undirected links and consist solely of instances of the entity data type <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>>. The attribute <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship.rep_2,rep_2>> of the derived instances is directed towards the root, while the attribute <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship.rep_1,rep_1>> is directed towards the leaf.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.nodes"
the list of <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> in the chain.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.undirected_link"
the list of items that relate nodes in the chain.

[NOTE]
--
The items in the *undirected_link* are placed correctly relative to the nodes in the chain but are not guaranteed to have a consistent direction along the chain.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.root"
the node that is the initial terminus of the chain.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.leaf"
the node that is the final terminus of the chain.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.directed_link"
the list of <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>> that are derived from the *undirected_link* and that are consistently directed from the root to the leaf.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.wr:WR1"
The <<express:product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.directed_link,directed_link>> attribute shall be valid for the given set of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.nodes,nodes>> and <<express:product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.undirected_link,undirected_link>>s.

[NOTE]
--
the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.get_directed_link,get_directed_link>> function returns indeterminate if it cannot construct a valid list. The EXPRESS EXISTS function returns FALSE with an indeterminate input.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.wr:WR2"
The *root* shall be referenced by the attribute <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship.rep_1,rep_1>> of the initial member of the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.directed_link,directed_link>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.wr:WR3"
The *leaf* shall be referenced by the attribute <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship.rep_2,rep_2>> of the final member of the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.directed_link,directed_link>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.wr:WR4"
If the first element in <<express:product_property_representation_schema.characterized_chain_based_item_within_representation.undirected_link,undirected_link>> is a <<express:representation_schema.mapped_item,mapped_item>>, then it shall be used in the root representation.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_item_within_representation"
A *characterized_item_within_representation* is a type of <<express:product_property_definition_schema.characterized_object,characterized_object>> that provides the characterization of a <<express:representation_schema.representation_item,representation_item>> within a specified <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_item_within_representation.item"
the <<express:representation_schema.representation_item,representation_item>> that is characterised.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_item_within_representation.rep"
the <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> in which the characterization of the <<express:representation_schema.representation_item,representation_item>> applies.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_item_within_representation.ur:UR1"
A <<express:representation_schema.representation_item,representation_item>> within a <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> shall be characterised at most once.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.characterized_item_within_representation.wr:WR1"
The *item* shall be founded in the specified <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.context_dependent_shape_representation"
A *context_dependent_shape_representation* is the association of a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation_relationship,shape_representation_relationship>> with a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.product_definition_shape,product_definition_shape>>. The <<express:product_property_definition_schema.product_definition_shape,product_definition_shape>> identifies the shape of a <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition,product_definition>> as it plays the role of the <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition_relationship.related_product_definition,related_product_definition>> in a <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition_relationship,product_definition_relationship>>. 

[NOTE]
--
The role of *context_dependent_shape_representation* can be defined in the annotated EXPRESS schemas that use or specialize this entity, or by default, in an agreement of common understanding between the partners sharing this information.
--

[example]
====
A gasket's shape depends upon whether the gasket is participating in an assembly relationship and, if it is a part of an assembly, the product or products with which it is assembled.
====

[example]
====
The position of a bolt's shape depends upon the way it is positioned in a given assembly.
====
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.context_dependent_shape_representation.representation_relation"
a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation_relationship,shape_representation_relationship>> that is associated with the <<express:product_property_definition_schema.product_definition_shape,product_definition_shape>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.context_dependent_shape_representation.represented_product_relation"
a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.product_definition_shape,product_definition_shape>> that identifies the shape of the related <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition,product_definition>> in the context of a <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition_relationship,product_definition_relationship>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.context_dependent_shape_representation.description"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.text,text>> that characterizes the *context_dependent_shape_representation*.

[NOTE]
--
This attribute is an upwardly compatible addition to *context_dependent_shape_representation* as specified in ISO 10303-41:1994.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.context_dependent_shape_representation.name"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.label,label>> by which the *context_dependent_shape_representation* is known.

[NOTE]
--
This attribute is an upwardly compatible addition to *context_dependent_shape_representation* as specified in ISO 10303-41:1994.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.context_dependent_shape_representation.wr:WR1"
The *represented_product_relation* shall identify the shape of a <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition_relationship,product_definition_relationship>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.context_dependent_shape_representation.wr:WR2"
Each *context_dependent_shape_representation* shall be the <<express:basic_attribute_schema.description_attribute.described_item,described_item>> in at most one <<express:basic_attribute_schema.description_attribute,description_attribute>>.

[NOTE]
--
The <<express:basic_attribute_schema.description_attribute,description_attribute>> data type is defined in <<express:basic_attribute_schema,basic_attribute_schema>> of this part of ISO 10303.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.context_dependent_shape_representation.wr:WR3"
Each *context_dependent_shape_representation* shall be the <<express:basic_attribute_schema.name_attribute.named_item,named_item>> in at most one <<express:basic_attribute_schema.name_attribute,name_attribute>>.

[NOTE]
--
The <<express:basic_attribute_schema.name_attribute,name_attribute>> data type is defined in <<express:basic_attribute_schema,basic_attribute_schema>> of this part of ISO 10303.
--

[NOTE]
--
A template for constraining the population of the entity data types defined in the <<express:basic_attribute_schema,basic_attribute_schema>> is described in annex E.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage"
An *item_identified_representation_usage* is an identification of a single or a set or a list of <<express:representation_schema.representation_item,representation_item>>(s) within a <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> as being the element(s) that describes a particular component or part of the property that is described by the <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>>. More than one <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>>. may be bound to a product data item by members of *item_identified_representation_usage* and more than one member of <<express:representation_schema.representation_item,representation_item>>(s) may be bound to a product data item by members of *item_identified_representation_usage*. The same item of product data shall not be bound to more than one member of <<express:representation_schema.representation_item,representation_item>> within a member of <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>>. 

[example]
====
In an application protocol, an instance of representation describes the shape of a product. One element of the <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> - a curve - represents the boundary of a *shape_aspect*, a hole, in the product. *Item_identification_representation_usage* is used to state that the curve referenced by 'identified_item' is a representation item for the *shape_aspect* referenced by 'definition' and that the whole representation is referenced by 'used_representation' to indicate the structural context for the curve. *Geometric_representation_context* plays no role in this example.
====

[example]
====
In an application protocol, an instance of representation describes the shape of a product. One element of the <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> - a curve - represents the boundary of a *shape_aspect*, a hole, in the product. A member of *Item_identification_representation_usage* is used to state that the curve referenced by 'identified_item' is a representation item for the *shape_aspect#1* referenced by 'definition' and that the whole representation is referenced by 'used_representation' to indicate the structural context for the curve. A second member of *Item_identification_representation_usage* references a different curve in that same <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> and references the same *shape_aspect#1*. The data population is invalid because only one item within a representation can be bound to a *shape_aspect*.
====
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.name"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.label,label>> by which the *item_identified_representation_usage* is known.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.description"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.text,text>> that characterizes the *item_identified_representation_usage*. The value of the attribute need not be specified.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.definition"
the <<express:product_property_definition_schema.general_property,general_property>>, <<express:product_property_definition_schema.property_definition,property_definition>>, <<express:material_property_definition_schema.property_definition_relationship,property_definition_relationship>>, <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect,shape_aspect>>, or <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect_relationship,shape_aspect_relationship>> that is represented.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.used_representation"
the <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> that describes the property or aspect of which the definition is a part or component, and that contains the *identified_item* (directly or indirectly) as one of its items.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.identified_item"
the <<express:representation_schema.representation_item,representation_item>> or <<express:representation_schema.list_representation_item,list_representation_item>> or <<express:representation_schema.set_representation_item,set_representation_item>> that describes the identified property or aspect.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.ur:UR1"
The combination of the *used_representation* and the *identified_item* shall be unique.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.ur:UR2"
The combination of the *used_representation* and the *definition* shall be unique.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.wr:WR1"
If the size of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.identified_item,identified_item>> is one then the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.used_representation,used_representation>> shall reference the item directly or indirectly.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_denotation"
A *property_definition_denotation* is an association between a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.represented_definition,represented_definition>> and a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.denoted_object_select,denoted_object_select>> for the purpose to assign additional meaning to the denoted object.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_denotation.name"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.label,label>> by which the *property_definition_denotation* is known. The value of the attribute need not be specified.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_denotation.description"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.text,text>> that characterizes the *property_definition_denotation*. The value of the attribute need not be specified.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_denotation.definition"
the <<express:product_property_definition_schema.general_property,general_property>>, <<express:product_property_definition_schema.property_definition,property_definition>>, <<express:material_property_definition_schema.property_definition_relationship,property_definition_relationship>>, <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect,shape_aspect>>, or <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect_relationship,shape_aspect_relationship>> that is represented.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_denotation.denoted_object"
the object that is denoted.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.wr:WR2"
If the size of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.identified_item,identified_item>> is greater than one then the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.item_identified_representation_usage.used_representation,used_representation>> shall be one of the <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>>s that reference the item directly or indirectly.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation"
A *property_definition_representation* is an association between a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.property_definition,property_definition>> and a representation of the property.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation.definition"
the identification of the <<express:product_property_definition_schema.general_property,general_property>>, <<express:product_property_definition_schema.property_definition,property_definition>>, <<express:material_property_definition_schema.property_definition_relationship,property_definition_relationship>>, <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect,shape_aspect>>, or <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect_relationship,shape_aspect_relationship>> that is represented.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation.used_representation"
the <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> of the property or aspect of the representation.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation.description"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.text,text>> that characterizes the *property_definition_representation*.

[NOTE]
--
This attribute is an upwardly compatible addition to *property_definition_representation* as specified in ISO 10303-41:1994.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation.name"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.label,label>> by which the *property_definition_representation* is known.

[NOTE]
--
This attribute is an upwardly compatible addition to *property_definition_representation* as specified in ISO 10303-41:1994.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation.wr:WR1"
Each *property_definition_representation* shall be the <<express:basic_attribute_schema.description_attribute.described_item,described_item>> in at most one <<express:basic_attribute_schema.description_attribute,description_attribute>>.

[NOTE]
--
The <<express:basic_attribute_schema.description_attribute,description_attribute>> data type is defined in <<express:basic_attribute_schema,basic_attribute_schema>> of this part of ISO 10303.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation.wr:WR2"
Each *property_definition_representation* shall be the <<express:basic_attribute_schema.name_attribute.named_item,named_item>> in at most one <<express:basic_attribute_schema.name_attribute,name_attribute>>.

[NOTE]
--
The <<express:basic_attribute_schema.name_attribute,name_attribute>> data type is defined in <<express:basic_attribute_schema,basic_attribute_schema>> of this part of ISO 10303.
--

[NOTE]
--
A template for constraining the population of the entity data types defined in the <<express:basic_attribute_schema,basic_attribute_schema>> is described in annex E.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_definition_representation"
A *shape_definition_representation* is a type of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation,property_definition_representation>>. A *shape_definition_representation* is the association of a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation,shape_representation>> with a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.product_definition_shape,product_definition_shape>> or with a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.property_definition,property_definition>> characterizing a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_definition,shape_definition>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_definition_representation.definition"
an inherited attribute whose value shall be of type <<express:product_property_definition_schema.property_definition,property_definition>>
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_definition_representation.used_representation"
an inherited attribute whose value shall be of type <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation,shape_representation>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_definition_representation.wr:WR1"
The inherited <<express:product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation.definition,definition>> attribute shall be a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.product_definition_shape,product_definition_shape>> or a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.property_definition,property_definition>> whose definition attribute is a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_definition,shape_definition>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_definition_representation.wr:WR2"
The inherited <<express:product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation.used_representation,used_representation>> attribute shall be a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation,shape_representation>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation"
A *shape_representation* is a type of <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> that represents a shape.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation_reference"
A *shape_representation_reference* is a type of <<express:representation_schema.representation_reference,representation_reference>> in which the referenced data type is a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation,shape_representation>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation_reference.wr:WR1"
The referenced data type is a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation,shape_representation>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation_relationship"
A *shape_representation_relationship* is a type of <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>> in which at least one of the instances of the entity data type <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> is a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation,shape_representation>> or <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation_reference,shape_representation_reference>>. 

[example]
====
The <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> of the shape of a bolt may be related to the representation of a position if the bolt is a part of an assembly.
====
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation_relationship.wr:WR1"
At least one of the two representations in the *shape_representation_relationship* shall be a <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation,shape_representation>> or <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation_reference,shape_representation_reference>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.specified_occurrence_context_dependent_shape_representation"
A *specified_occurrence_context_dependent_shape_representation* is a type of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.context_dependent_shape_representation,context_dependent_shape_representation>> that established a relation for a hierarchical product structure using <<express:product_structure_schema.product_definition_specified_occurrence,product_definition_specified_occurrence>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.specified_occurrence_context_dependent_shape_representation.sub_element"
the <<express:product_structure_schema.product_definition_specified_occurrence,product_definition_specified_occurrence>> for which the association established by the inherited attributes *representation_relation* and *represented_product_relation* applies.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.specified_occurrence_context_dependent_shape_representation.wr:WR1"
The <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition_relationship.related_product_definition,related_product_definition>> of the *represented_product_relation* shall be of type <<express:product_structure_schema.product_definition_occurrence,product_definition_occurrence>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.specified_occurrence_context_dependent_shape_representation.wr:WR2"
The *sub_element* shall be within the <<express:product_structure_schema.product_definition_occurrence.descendant_occurrences,descendant_occurrences>> of the <<express:product_structure_schema.product_definition_occurrence,product_definition_occurrence>> that is referenced by the <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition_relationship.related_product_definition,related_product_definition>> of the *represented_product_relation*.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.get_directed_link"
The *get_directed_link* function returns for any list of <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> and associated list of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.chained_representation_link,chained_representation_link>> the resolved list of <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>> when each member of *undirected_link* references the correct members of *nodes*. The *get_directed_link* function returns UNKNOWN when the input does not satisfy the correctness requirement.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.get_directed_link.nodes"
(input) the list of instances of the entity data type <<express:representation_schema.representation,representation>> to be used as a reference for constructing the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.directed_link,directed_link>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.get_directed_link.undirected_link"
(input) the list of instances of the entity data type <<express:representation_schema.mapped_item,mapped_item>>, <<express:representation_schema.representation_context,representation_context>>, or <<express:representation_schema.representation_relationship,representation_relationship>> that the function is comparing against the reference to establish the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.chain_based_item_identified_representation_usage.directed_link,directed_link>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.relatives_of_product_definitions"
The *relatives_of_product_definitions* function finds all of the instances of the <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition,product_definition>> entity data type that are related to one or more elements of the *definition_set* argument. Only those relationships that are established by the subtype of the <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition_relationship,product_definition_relationship>> entity given in the *relation_subtype* argument are considered by this function.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.relatives_of_product_definitions.definition_set"
(input) the set of instances of the entity data type <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition,product_definition>> upon which operations are performed.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.relatives_of_product_definitions.relation_subtype"
the fully qualified name of an entity that is a subtype of the <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition_relationship,product_definition_relationship>> entity.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.relatives_of_shape_representations"
The *relatives_of_shape_representations* function finds all of the instances of the <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation,shape_representation>> entity data type that are related to one or more elements of the *shape_representation_set* argument. 

[NOTE]
--
This function is not used in this schema. It is defined here because other ISO 10303 integrated resources and application protocols that use the <<express:management_resources_schema.identification_assignment_relationship,identification_assignment_relationship>> entity include rules that use this function.
--
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.relatives_of_shape_representations.shape_representation_set"
(input) the set of instances of the entity data type <<express:product_property_representation_schema.shape_representation,shape_representation>> to be operated on.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.get_property_definition_representations"
The *get_property_definition_representations* function returns for any <<express:product_property_definition_schema.characterized_definition,characterized_definition>> the set of <<express:product_property_representation_schema.property_definition_representation,property_definition_representation>> objects that refer to the <<express:product_property_definition_schema.characterized_definition,characterized_definition>> through a <<express:product_property_definition_schema.property_definition,property_definition>>.
*)

(*"product_property_representation_schema.get_property_definition_representations.c_def_instance"
(input) the candidate <<express:product_property_definition_schema.characterized_definition,characterized_definition>> to be checked.
*)
